   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "widgets_values": [
    "# 01b · Krea 2 — fast & natural (one pass)\n**Use:** write the **prompt** on the node → set size → Run → `H3test/krea2_simple_*.png`. ≈ 14 s at 2 MP (6 s at 1 MP).\n**Default 1280×1600 = 2 MP** (series 2: Krea 2 is trained up to 2048², 2 MP shows real pores and freckles; 896×1120 stays as a fast draft size).\nOne pass, 8 steps, euler/beta, cfg 1, `qwen_image_vae` — the most natural \"phone photo\" look.\n**realism LoRAs** toggle adds Realism Engine 0.5 + Realistic Snapshot 0.9 (glossier).\n\n**Prompt tips:** booru-style tags work as well as prose (`photo \\(medium\\), crisp detailed instagram photograph` = glossy,\n`amateur phone photo` = raw). Body shape needs **strong** words (`slightly chubby body, curvy, thick, huge breasts, wide hips,\nbig round butt, thick thighs`) plus a body–pose relation — soft words (large, full, curvy hourglass) are ignored at cfg 1.\nWrite the age explicitly (25+, late-20s, mature facial features). For video stills use a 4:5 size (896×1120).\n\n**Measured:** RTX 5070 Ti 16 GB, ComfyUI 0.42.4 · 1000×1600, 8 steps: **13–14 s** warm (32 s incl. first model load) · peak VRAM 15.2 GB"
   ]
  },
